{%- comment -%}
  DISCOVER VRL HERO — the Discover VRL page's hero (Assets/Lava/Partials/
  VideoHero.lava, Styles/_video-hero.scss), as the ministry pages'.

  Block:                    an HTML block in the Discover VRL page's Feature zone
  Block content:            {% include '~~/Assets/Lava/DiscoverVRLHero.lava' %}
  Enabled Lava Commands:    none
  Page:                     InnerDefault, PageHeaderStyle Hidden, DarkHeader
                            checked

  The title is the page's title ("Discover VRL"); the lead line under it is
  the page's Description (Page Properties). The button jumps to What to expect
  on this page.
  The video: "We are VRL", Rock media element 1157 (Rock's media player, so
  views are tracked like the messages).

  The page content under it: Assets/Lava/DiscoverVRL.lava (Main zone).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign heroKicker = 'New here?' -%}
{%- assign heroMediaId = 1157 -%}
{%- capture heroActions -%}
  <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#expect">Plan your visit</a>
{%- endcapture -%}
{% include '~~/Assets/Lava/Partials/VideoHero.lava' %}
